        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Upanishads</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 700 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Mostly anonymous; teachings are attributed to sages such as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yajnavalkya">Yajnavalkya</a>, Uddalaka Aruni and Shvetaketu, and the Shvetashvatara names its own author; scholars regard the existing texts as the work of many authors</span></div>
